  "name": "Implement CombatSimulator Application Service",
  "description": "Create the CombatSimulator application service - orchestrates complete combat.\n\nFile: src/application/combat_simulator.py\n\nImplementation requirements:\n- Application service (orchestrates domain services)\n- Constructor takes InitiativeResolver, AttackResolver, CombatRound\n- Method: simulate(char1: Character, char2: Character, dice_roller: DiceRoller) -> CombatResult\n- Rolls initiative ONCE at start (not per round)\n- Runs rounds until one character reaches 0 HP\n- Returns complete CombatResult with all rounds recorded",
  "motivation": "CombatSimulator is the main entry point - orchestrates the complete combat flow",
  "estimated_hours": 1.0,
